## Execution
Runs: batch

Expected wall time: <1 minute
Expected output size: ~200 KB (CSVs + 2 PNG plots)

Single Python script (`scripts/run_pca.py`) executed in gars-bio conda environment. PCA computation is lightweight and deterministic; no intermediate jobs. Standard Slurm batch submission is appropriate per decision 0027.
